      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yet another feature that people using modded clients get that we don't. Everywhere I go everyone is using clients that do things like this.\nI don't get how one person in their free time can do so much while the entire vrchat team of paid developers puts out a minor patch once every 3 months that doesn't affect gameplay much.\nHere's to hoping this feature is in the reworked UI coming in the next.... who knows how long.",
